      "range": "1281-1300",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "简单是长期努力工作的结果，而不是起点。",
      "totalCount": 12400
    },
    {
      "bookId": "837932",
      "userVid": 49218840,
      "bookmarkId": "837932_97_3202-3244",
      "chapterUid": 97,
      "range": "3202-3244",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果某个人的思维模式在生活中给他带来好处，那么这种模式往往会变成他最坚定不移的信念。",
      "totalCount": 12096
    },
    {
